{"id": "html_000105", "instruction": "Build a production-quality, accessible cards component in neon_emerald style.", "context": {"framework": "html-css-tailwind", "requirements": ["html", "cards", "production-quality"], "category": "cards"}, "input": "", "output": "<section class=\"py-16 bg-[#06110d] text-zinc-100\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\">\n    <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-emerald-400 mb-2\">Engineered Modules</h2>\n      <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">Core Architectural Building Blocks</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      <article class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-900/50 hover:border-zinc-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-4\">01</div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Minimal Change Engine</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Isolates root cause anomalies and applies surgical 1-file diffs while strictly preserving working production logic.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500\">\n          <span>Module v1.175</span>\n          <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">Verified [OK]</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-900/50 hover:border-zinc-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-4\">02</div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Multi-Level Playwright Tests</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Levels 1 through 7 static compilation, build validation, browser DOM verification, and full WCAG accessibility audits.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500\">\n          <span>Suite 7-Tier</span>\n          <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">100% Pass</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-900/50 hover:border-zinc-700 transition flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-4\">03</div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Hardware-Gated Concurrency</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Monitors GPU VRAM and system memory in real time to throttle subagent concurrency and prevent thrashing.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500\">\n          <span>VRAM Guard</span>\n          <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">Safe 6GB</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>", "metadata": {"category": "cards", "difficulty": "medium", "quality": 0.835}}
